   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:1ad",
   "ptr": "0x1ad",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「おれには、今この瞬間こそが、幻影の\\n",
   "en": "\"To me, it's this very moment that feels like the illusion.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "カイエス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:1d6",
   "ptr": "0x1d6",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　ような気がしてならん」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:1ad"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:201",
   "ptr": "0x201",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "呪い師\\n",
   "en": "Mystic",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:20c",
   "ptr": "0x20c",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "「・・・幻影？\\n",
   "en": "\"...An illusion? Why do you declare this world an illusion?",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "呪い師\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:21f",
   "ptr": "0x21f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　なぜ、あなたはこの世界を幻影と言い\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:20c"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:248",
   "ptr": "0x248",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　切るのですか？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:20c"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:25e",
   "ptr": "0x25e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　確かにあなたは、様々な出会いと戦い\\n",
   "en": "Surely you believe you stand here now after many encounters and battles.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:287",
   "ptr": "0x287",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　を経て、今、ここにいるとの思いを持\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:25e"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:2b0",
   "ptr": "0x2b0",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　たれてるでしょう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:25e"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:2ca",
   "ptr": "0x2ca",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　しかし、それもまた、鏡の誘いによる\\n",
   "en": "Yet that, too, is but one of the illusions shown to you in the meditation the mirror invited you into...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:2f3",
   "ptr": "0x2f3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　メディテーションで見せられた幻影の\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:2ca"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:31c",
   "ptr": "0x31c",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　ひとつ・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:2ca"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:330",
   "ptr": "0x330",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あなたが見ていたのは、選ぶべき運命\\n",
   "en": "What you saw was no more than a single thread among the threads of fate you are to choose from...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:359",
   "ptr": "0x359",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　の織り糸の一本でしかない・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:330"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:37f",
   "ptr": "0x37f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あなたは始めから、ここ谷間の遺跡を\\n",
   "en": "From the very start, you have not taken one step from these Valley Ruins.\"",
