   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "呪い師\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:4f6",
   "ptr": "0x4f6",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　なるほど、剣技ですか・・・\\n",
   "en": "I see. Sword skill, is it... Heh heh heh... That was a miscalculation.",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:517",
   "ptr": "0x517",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　くっくっく・・・これは誤算でした。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　なるほど、剣技ですか・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:4f6"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:541",
   "ptr": "0x541",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　私の魔鏡は魅せられた者の魂を囚え、\\n",
   "en": "My Magic Mirror ensnares the souls of those it enthralls, and rules their fate.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:56a",
   "ptr": "0x56a",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　その運命を支配する。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:541"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:586",
   "ptr": "0x586",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　今から、あなたは《黒の剣》を振るう\\n",
   "en": "From here, you were to be led toward your fate as the Demon Lord who wields the Black Sword.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:5af",
   "ptr": "0x5af",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　魔王としての運命へ導かれるはずだっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:586"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:5d8",
   "ptr": "0x5d8",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　た。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:586"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:5e4",
   "ptr": "0x5e4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そして、その運命を自ら選択するはず\\n",
   "en": "And you were to choose that fate of your own will...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:60d",
   "ptr": "0x60d",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　だった・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:5e4"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:621",
   "ptr": "0x621",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　そう・・・ここは鏡の中・・・\\n",
   "en": "Yes... this is inside the mirror... an illusory past made by the Magic Mirror. And you, here, are an illusion cast into the mirror as well...",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:644",
   "ptr": "0x644",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　魔鏡が創り出した、幻影の過去。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:621"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:669",
   "ptr": "0x669",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ここにいるあなたもまた、鏡に投影さ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:621"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:692",
   "ptr": "0x692",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　れた幻影・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:621"
  },
