   "id": "10TNI03A:6a8",
   "ptr": "0x6a8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　本来なら、何もかもが、あなたが最初\\n",
   "en": "By rights, all should be just as it was when you first accepted the mirror meditation. And yet...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:6d1",
   "ptr": "0x6d1",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　に鏡のメディテーションを受け入れた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:6a8"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:6fa",
   "ptr": "0x6fa",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　時のままのはず。それが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:6a8"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:71e",
   "ptr": "0x71e",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　さすがは継承者と言うべきか・・・\\n",
   "en": "Is this what it means to be an heir...? Or does the Black Sword simply favor swordsmen...\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:745",
   "ptr": "0x745",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　いや、剣士という存在が《黒の剣》に\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 10TNI03A:71e"
  },
  {
   "id": "10TNI03A:76e",
